  "LOD_FADE_CROSSFADE": "no LODGroup fades: PC_RPAsset m_EnableLODCrossFade 1 keeps the variants, but every LODGroup in the built scenes has fade mode None (OldTown.unity 2,204, the lean copy 1,914; PlantingSwap077 makes them with LODFadeMode.None; no player code sets fadeMode). Checked per build: a built scene with a fading LODGroup keeps the variants",
  "_LIGHT_COOKIES (off)": "the sun always carries the cloud cookie: Look097 puts it on the scene's directional light in every scene with one (the night's moon is the same light), so the keyword is on for every lit draw. URP's cookie path is a no-op for a light without one (LightCookieManager.SetupMainLight binds white and format None; LightCookie.hlsl SampleMainLightCookie returns 1). Kept when look097.json turns clouds off; -noclouds draws the cookie variant with no cookie (Unity's nearest variant: checked in shots)"
 },
